examples/ref_hwr200.npy is one line of the HWR200 dataset (AntiplagiatCompany/HWR200, Apache-2.0), scan traced to pen strokes.
The style encoder was also trained on traced HWR200 lines.
The tracer (trace/) was trained on data credited in trace/TRAINING_DATA.md, including BRUSH, MathWriting, Korean Handwriting Strokes, OUHD-L, Make Me a Hanzi and Google Fonts.
examples/from_scan.png shows one line of HWR200.
trace/example_open_lines.png includes a render of Korean Handwriting Strokes by Jonathan Baudanza (hangul.ink), handwriting by Jo YW, CC BY-SA 4.0, and so is under CC BY-SA 4.0; it also shows OUHD-L (CC BY 4.0) and Digital Peter (MIT).
The recogniser (ckpt_ctc4) was also trained on traced HWR200 lines.
tablet/samsung/sdocx2ink.mjs uses the npm package @twango/sdocx (GPL-3.0, https://github.com/twangodev/sdocx). npm installs it separately; it is not distributed here.
